Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.40,Hook,,0,0,0,,Add text to photos free
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,Put OPEN SUNDAY on your shop photo for free, right in your browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:08.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is Photopea, a free photo editor that runs in the browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:10.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tap Start using Photopea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:13.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,We didn't sign in or install anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:16.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,Drag your photo onto the drop box, and it opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.35,0:00:20.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,Press T for the text tool, click where you want the words, and type.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:22.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Hit the check mark to confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:26.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then go to File, Export as, and pick JPG.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:30.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,Slide the quality down, and the file size shrinks before you save.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:34.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,Photopea says your files never leave your device.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.25,0:00:40.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,The catch: the free version runs on ads, and they can cover 5 to 15% of your screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:45.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Send this to the friend who pays for an editor just to add text to photos!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.40,0:00:40.60,Lab,,0,0,0,,Ad space
